  "description": {
    "text": "Rockruff Full Power Deck, a 60-card deck given away with the January 2017 issue of the children's magazine Monthly CoroCoro Comic, on sale around 15 December 2016 and found nowhere else. It holds Rockruff and its evolution Lycanroc-GX, whose GX attack deals 200 damage, so a reader could try a GX attack with this deck alone.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: 12月発売の月刊コロコロコミックの付録で、「ルガルガンGX」入りのイワンコ全力デッキを手に入れろ！",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170504125555/http://www.pokemon-card.com/info/2016/20161015_000319.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "An \"SMP1\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 013",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game 30th Anniversary Archive (The Pokémon Company): each card's expansion mark",
        "url": "https://www.30tharchive.pokemon-card.com/"
      }
    ]
  },
